    "article_summary": "The article describes a three-component asymmetric radical 1,4-functionalization of 1,3-enynes using dual photoredox and chromium catalysis. This redox-neutral method employs DHP esters, organotrifluoroborates, or NHPI esters as radical precursors to synthesize chiral \u03b1-allenols with simultaneous control of axial and central chiralities, featuring high regioselectivity and broad functional group compatibility.",
